{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600080","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1360008001:0":{"text":"Ah! It didn't get damaged, did it?","source_cn":"诶呀！不会受到损伤了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB586B1EB40BD64C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1360008002:0":{"text":"Whew, it's fine! The Floralis Nexus structure's still holding up.","source_cn":"……还好还好，青藤之心的结构没什么大问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x829415D9228036C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1360008003:1":{"text":"Attack performance... eh, decent. How's the limb balance looking? Petal, help me out here, will you?","source_cn":"攻击性能……尚可，肢体平衡性呢……？一叶，你帮忙看看好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22873C35042145D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1360008004:1":{"text":"Chirp chirp!","source_cn":"——唧唧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151077E2B35AB5DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1360008004":{"text":"Chirp chirp!","source_cn":"——唧唧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151077E2B35AB5DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360008005:1":{"text":"Chirp chirp!","source_cn":"唧唧~唧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85372303F07FC40C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1360008007:1":{"text":"Damian... weren't you all grumpy about the Maulers skipping the costume tradition and going straight to battle?","source_cn":"达米安……你说过，蛮血部落有人懒得扮演怪兽，直接自己上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DDC025CB1D66A5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1360008008:1":{"text":"But here you are, skipping tradition too! Wrapping a living glimmerbloom in a mechanical shell... This isn't even engineering anymore.","source_cn":"可直接和活的荧荧花合作，在外面组装外壳……先不谈创意，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13069A343E74F731","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360008009:1":{"text":"It's more like... a magical creature performance than a true test of your invention skills.","source_cn":"相比大发明家，更像是和魔法生物配合的演出……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB2D3B1B15A06CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1360008010:1":{"text":"Chirp, chirp chirp!","source_cn":"——唧！唧唧唧！唧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99EC2E921CC8EA7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1360008011:1":{"text":"... You're right...","source_cn":"……唔，也是啦，你们说得对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3D457F956A25166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1360008012:1":{"text":"I guess I got so caught up in chasing after creativity and flair that I kinda forgot what inventing is really about.","source_cn":"是我之前过于追求绿裔特色和创意，结果反而走上了歧途，忘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x943B53E3E120E1DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1360008013:1":{"text":"Thanks for the wake-up call! I'm gonna rebuild the Floralis Nexus!","source_cn":"谢谢你们的帮忙和提醒！我打算重建青藤之心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1D9DE9D3DA02A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360008014:1":{"text":"Even the simplest bit of woodworking, when mixed with my magic and imagination, will shine brighter than anything else in the world!","source_cn":"再朴素的木工，有了我的创意与魔法，也绝对能焕发出独一无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F86EF52DB30503B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1360008014":{"text":"Even the simplest bit of woodworking, when mixed with my magic and imagination, will shine brighter than anything else in the world!","source_cn":"再朴素的木工，有了我的创意与魔法，也绝对能焕发出独一无二的光彩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F86EF52DB30503B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1360008015:1":{"text":"Ambition's not enough! I gotta put it into action! Full research mode, here I come!","source_cn":"光有志气还不够，必须要落实才行，我准备去闭关研发了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24E092B0FD1E7883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360008017:1":{"text":"Oh, by the way, weren't you guys looking for unique lanterns and decorations?","source_cn":"啊，对了，我记得你们是想找有特色的彩灯和染色装饰吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F9A9A7CAC958D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1360008018:1":{"text":"We stick to the traditional ones here. I mean, we've got the Lucent Tree lighting up the whole place! Can't steal its spotlight, right?","source_cn":"因为能仰望到流荧树，所以我们村中的装饰都比较传统，毕竟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F5C15E22CA3091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1360008019:1":{"text":"And the glowing plants, animals, and bugs? They lose their color if they leave the forest. I tested it myself!","source_cn":"周围栖息的会发光的动植物，乃至小昆虫，离开丛林后也会失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E8E9B88A983A0B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1360008020:1":{"text":"But I think Jade Lake Academy comes up with new lantern designs every year. Florabelle handles that kind of stuff.","source_cn":"但据我所知，瓦度索山脉的翡湖学院每年都会制作和设计一些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA7702726528826C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1360008021:0":{"text":"Does the academy have courses on decorating?","source_cn":"翡湖学院还有这种课程啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AF431EF23942469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360008022:1":{"text":"They call it \"aesthetic sense\" and \"understanding plant ecology\". But come on, it's basically just arts and crafts for kids!","source_cn":"说是要培养审美和对植物生态的理解，不过在我看来，就是小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD3721549A7EE83B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360008023:1":{"text":"You're a kid yourself, Damian!","source_cn":"明明你自己也是个小孩子……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81E62177F941872A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1360008024:1":{"text":"I'm not like those mischievous brats—I'm the Great Inventor Damian!","source_cn":"我和那些顽皮的小孩可不一样，我是大发明家达米安！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29222F020417ECCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1360008024":{"text":"I'm not like those mischievous brats—I'm the Great Inventor Damian!","source_cn":"我和那些顽皮的小孩可不一样，我是大发明家达米安！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29222F020417ECCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1360008027:0":{"text":"Alright, I'm heading back to work on the Floralis Nexus Mark IV. If you're going to the academy, make sure you're back before dinner.","source_cn":"好啦，我要去研发青藤之心四号了，你们如果要去学院，记得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EF42581569F5411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1360008028:0":{"text":"Granny's cooking, and if you're late, I'm the one who'll get scolded!","source_cn":"婆婆会做好晚饭等你们的！要是错过了婆婆的晚饭，挨骂的只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD91C0F0C82FEBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"Yes, of course you are!","source_cn":"是是是","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BFC87A4B6528541","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, of course you are!","female":"Yes, of course you are!","variant_male_record_index":"70358","variant_female_record_index":"70359","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1360008025:0":{"text":"I'm not immature! I'm filled with creativity! Crea-ti-vity! Got it?","source_cn":"对我来说，不算顽皮，叫富、有、创、意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF2EAD8BD134D7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:1:2":{"text":"Even inventors can be immature.","source_cn":"大发明家也可以顽皮","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10E78AB04C6571A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Even inventors can be immature.","female":"Even inventors can be immature.","variant_male_record_index":"70360","variant_female_record_index":"70361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1360008026:0":{"text":"It's not about age; it's about having a sharp mind and a clear vision!","source_cn":"重点不在于年龄，而在于敏锐的头脑和眼界！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x848762E5DFA6E79A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:2:3":{"text":"It's cute how you act mature.","source_cn":"只有小孩才会嚷嚷自己是大人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9930C548765AA746","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's cute how you act mature.","female":"It's cute how you act mature.","variant_male_record_index":"70362","variant_female_record_index":"70363","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_